# 2️⃣ Stack using Linked List

## 📖 Idea

The Head node acts as the Top of the stack.

---

### Visualization

```
TOP

↓

40

↓

30

↓

20

↓

10
```

---

### C++ Structure

```cpp
struct Node
{
    int data;
    Node* next;

    Node(int val)
    {
        data = val;
        next = NULL;
    }
};
```

---

### Push

```
New Node

↓

Head
```

---

### Pop

```
Delete Head

↓

Move Head
```

---

### Complexity

| Operation | Time |
|-----------|------|
| Push | O(1) |
| Pop | O(1) |
| Peek | O(1) |

