# 3️⃣ C++ STL Stack

The C++ Standard Library provides the `stack` container.

---

### Syntax

```cpp
#include <stack>

stack<int> st;
```

---

### Common Operations

```cpp
st.push(10);

st.push(20);

st.pop();

st.top();

st.empty();

st.size();
```

---

### Example

```cpp
#include<iostream>
#include<stack>
using namespace std;

int main()
{
    stack<int> st;

    st.push(10);
    st.push(20);
    st.push(30);

    cout << st.top();

    st.pop();

    cout << st.top();
}
```

