# 4️⃣ Valid Parentheses

## 📖 Problem

Determine whether parentheses are balanced.

---

### Example

```
()

[]

{}

Output

True
```

---

### Invalid Example

```
([)]

Output

False
```

---

### Approach

```
Opening Bracket

↓

Push

Closing Bracket

↓

Check Top

↓

Pop
```

---

### Complexity

```
Time : O(n)

Space : O(n)
```

