# ⚠️ Common Mistakes

❌ Accessing `top()` on an empty stack.

❌ Forgetting to pop matched brackets.

❌ Using recursion instead of a stack when iterative solutions are expected.

❌ Not checking stack emptiness before accessing the top element.

